      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} What i was getting at is i've never seen or heard of a crash with a large differential between near and far planes.  It had to have been very rare.  My own world was one such case that has an occlusion portal wall but is otherwise a vast expanse of space; nobody was crashing to my knowledge.  It had to have been a very rare anomalous case, or perhaps mapped culling being too far away or something.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
